.TH std::generator::promise_type::initial_suspend 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::generator::promise_type::initial_suspend \- std::generator::promise_type::initial_suspend

.SH Synopsis
std::suspend_always initial_suspend() const noexcept;  (since C++23)

Informs that std::generator always starts lazily (in suspended state).

Equivalent to return std::suspend_always{};.

.SH Return value

An awaitable object.
